+#===- nonleaf-zero.README.txt - Raw zero call-line fixture ----------------===#
+Derived from head.perfbin (same instruction bytes and leaf lines).
+GNU readelf --debug-dump=info identifies DW_AT_call_line at .debug_info
+relative offsets 0xcc and 0xe8, both data1=12. The .debug_info file offset
+is 0x4ac (readelf -SW). Replace these two bytes with zero; do not alter
+leaf line tables, function ranges or code. This creates raw non-leaf
+line zero without making usable leaf lines zero.
